  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Peptide</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Dark Circles</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>Cooling hydrogel eye patches that depuff and brighten under the eyes while helping to reduce the look of fine lines and dark circles. </p><p><br></p><p><strong>Skin Type: </strong>Normal, Dry, and Combination </p><p><br></p><p><strong>Skincare Concerns: </strong>Dark Circles, Dryness, and Fine Lines and Wrinkles</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Formulation:</strong> Mask</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients:</strong></p><p>- Caffeine: Known to reduce the appearance of puffy under-eyes.</p><p>- Peptide: Improves the look of dark circles, making the under-eyes look brighter.</p><p>- Sodium PCA: An amino acid derivative that moisturizes for softer skin.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;\" ><strong>Suggested Usage:</strong></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;\">-Apply to clean, dry under-eye area for 10 to 15 minutes.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;\">-Use two to three times per week for best results, or as needed.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;\"><br></p><p>rhode trick: Tap on half a pump of Peptide Glazing Fluid (sold separately) under each eye, then apply Peptide Eye Prep on top.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;\" >-Caffeine: Reduces the appearance of puffy undereyes.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;\">-Peptide: Improves the look of dark circles and makes the under-eye area look brighter.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;\">-Sodium PCA: An amino acid derivative that moisturizes for softer skin.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;\">Water/Aqua/Eau, Glycerin, Sodium Polyacrylate, Polyvinyl Alcohol, Sodium PCA, Acetyl Tetrapeptide-5, Caffeine, Cocos Nucifera (Coconut) Oil, Tartaric Acid, Chondrus Crispus Powder, Ceratonia Siliqua (Carob) Gum, Hydroxyacetophenone, Carrageenan, Xanthan Gum, Agar, Polyglyceryl-3 Methylglucose Distearate, Polyacrylic Acid, Butylene Glycol, Potassium Chloride, Aluminum Glycinate, Sodium Phytate, Chlorphenesin.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;\"><br></p><p>&nbsp;<em>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</em></p></div></details>",
